L["v%s. /talents opens the planner. /talents next and /talents all place planned points. /talents save <name>, /talents builds, /talents open <name>, /talents plans, /talents plan <name>, /talents find <talent>, /talents undo, /talents settings, /talents key, /talents import <link or code>, /talents share, /talents reset, /talents scale <n>, /talents center, /talents inspect, /talents party, /talents trainer, /talents trainall, /talents nudge, /talents sounds, /talents minimap, /talents intro, /talents log."] = "v%s. /talents öffnet den Planer. /talents next und /talents all setzen geplante Punkte. /talents save <name>, /talents builds, /talents open <name>, /talents plans, /talents plan <name>, /talents find <talent>, /talents undo, /talents settings, /talents key, /talents import <link or code>, /talents share, /talents reset, /talents scale <n>, /talents center, /talents inspect, /talents party, /talents trainer, /talents trainall, /talents nudge, /talents sounds, /talents minimap, /talents intro, /talents log."
